{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"control-lesson04","version":1,"title":"線形制御理論","subtitle":"第4回 · 元の第5回・一次系と二次系の応答","scope":"線形制御理論【第5回】講義資料.pdf、全26物理ページ。元の第5回・一次系と二次系の応答。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期水３]線形制御理論/授業資料/線形制御理論【第5回】講義資料.pdf","sha256":"60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534","pageCount":26,"reviewedPages":[12,14,15,17,18,25,26],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"control-l04-q01","version":1,"prompt":"\\(H(s)=1/(s+a)\\)、a>0の一次系の時定数は？","answer":"\\(1/a\\)。","criterion":"減衰率aの逆数と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"線形制御理論【第5回】講義資料.pdf","page":12,"imageKey":"60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:12"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(s)=1/(s+a)</annotation></semantics></math></span>、a&gt;0の一次系の時定数は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/a</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"減衰率aの逆数と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"control-l04-q02","version":1,"prompt":"実係数二次系\\(H(s)=1/(s^2+a_1s+a_2)\\)の極がすべて開左半平面にあるための条件は？","answer":"\\(a_1>0,\\ a_2>0\\)。","criterion":"両係数が正と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"線形制御理論【第5回】講義資料.pdf","page":14,"imageKey":"60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:14"}],"promptHtml":"実係数二次系<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(s)=1/(s^2+a_1s+a_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>の極がすべて開左半平面にあるための条件は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_1&gt;0,\\ a_2&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"両係数が正と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"control-l04-q03","version":1,"prompt":"二次系の分母\\(s^2+2\\zeta\\omega_ns+\\omega_n^2\\)で、ωn>0。0<ζ<1、ζ=1、ζ>1で極はそれぞれどうなる？","answer":"共役複素数、負の重根、相異なる負の実数。","criterion":"ζの3範囲に対応する極の型を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"線形制御理論【第5回】講義資料.pdf","page":15,"imageKey":"60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:15"}],"promptHtml":"二次系の分母<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ζ</mi><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s^2+2\\zeta\\omega_ns+\\omega_n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>で、ωn&gt;0。0&lt;ζ&lt;1、ζ=1、ζ&gt;1で極はそれぞれどうなる？","answerHtml":"共役複素数、負の重根、相異なる負の実数。","criterionHtml":"ζの3範囲に対応する極の型を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"control-l04-q04","version":1,"prompt":"二次系の極が\\(-\\zeta\\omega_n\\pm i\\omega_n\\sqrt{1-\\zeta^2}\\)、0<ζ<1のとき、応答に現れる振動の角周波数は？","answer":"\\(\\omega_n\\sqrt{1-\\zeta^2}\\)。","criterion":"極の虚部の絶対値と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"線形制御理論【第5回】講義資料.pdf","page":17,"imageKey":"60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:17"}],"promptHtml":"二次系の極が<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ζ</mi><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>±</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ζ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\zeta\\omega_n\\pm i\\omega_n\\sqrt{1-\\zeta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>、0&lt;ζ&lt;1のとき、応答に現れる振動の角周波数は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ζ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_n\\sqrt{1-\\zeta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"極の虚部の絶対値と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"control-l04-q05","version":1,"prompt":"安定な系の単純極\\(p=\\sigma+i\\omega\\)が生むモード\\(e^{pt}\\)で、減衰の速さを決めるのは実部と虚部のどちら？","answer":"実部σ。負で、絶対値が大きいほど速く減衰する。","criterion":"実部が振幅の減衰を決めると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"線形制御理論【第5回】講義資料.pdf","page":26,"imageKey":"60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:26"}],"promptHtml":"安定な系の単純極<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=\\sigma+i\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span>が生むモード<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{pt}</annotation></semantics></math></span>で、減衰の速さを決めるのは実部と虚部のどちら？","answerHtml":"実部σ。負で、絶対値が大きいほど速く減衰する。","criterionHtml":"実部が振幅の減衰を決めると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"control-l04-q06","version":1,"prompt":"\\(H(s)=1/(s^2+2\\zeta\\omega_ns+\\omega_n^2)\\)、ωn>0、ζ>0、初期値0の単位ステップ応答の最終値は？","answer":"\\(H(0)=1/\\omega_n^2\\)。","criterion":"分子が1なので最終値は1ではなく1/ωn²と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"線形制御理論【第5回】講義資料.pdf","page":18,"imageKey":"60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:18"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ζ</mi><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(s)=1/(s^2+2\\zeta\\omega_ns+\\omega_n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>、ωn&gt;0、ζ&gt;0、初期値0の単位ステップ応答の最終値は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msubsup><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(0)=1/\\omega_n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"分子が1なので最終値は1ではなく1/ωn²と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"control-l04-q07","version":1,"prompt":"質量M、ばね定数K、粘性抵抗係数Dの系\\(M\\ddot x+D\\dot x+Kx=F\\)で、自然角周波数ωnと減衰係数ζは？M,K>0とする。","answer":"\\(\\omega_n=\\sqrt{K/M},\\quad\\zeta=D/(2\\sqrt{KM})\\)。","criterion":"両方の式を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"線形制御理論【第5回】講義資料.pdf","page":25,"imageKey":"60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:25"}],"promptHtml":"質量M、ばね定数K、粘性抵抗係数Dの系<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M\\ddot x+D\\dot x+Kx=F</annotation></semantics></math></span>で、自然角周波数ωnと減衰係数ζは？M,K&gt;0とする。","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>ζ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega_n=\\sqrt{K/M},\\quad\\zeta=D/(2\\sqrt{KM})</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"両方の式を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:12":"./assets/sources/60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534-12.png","60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:14":"./assets/sources/60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534-14.png","60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:15":"./assets/sources/60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534-15.png","60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:17":"./assets/sources/60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534-17.png","60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:26":"./assets/sources/60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534-26.png","60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:18":"./assets/sources/60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534-18.png","60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534:25":"./assets/sources/60b8e0eec5985955a9acb3c548a674c348131fae7c1c4c2461b6a9be5e79f534-25.png"},"renderVersi